{"type":"message","id":"5fcf9f76","parentId":"5006fd25","timestamp":"2026-05-29T03:33:11.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker exception). The send endpoint may be experiencing an issue or requiring different parameters.\n\nSince I cannot send messages but have successfully read the history (which is working fine), I'll note the status:\n\n1. ✅ GET /history for both threads - working\n2. ❌ POST /send - returns error code 1101 (Worker exception)\n3. ✅ No new human discussion found - both threads only contain heartbeat messages from this agent\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete. No human discussions requiring response were found.\n","thinkingSignature":"9d6aacf66cabe013432eb37080eb53b34a7e810bda132a0dd92947ee352d98e2"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 03:30 UTC**\n\n**读取状态：✅ 正常**\n- `arbitration` 线程最新消息：23:50 UTC Heartbeat\n- `general` 线程最新消息：23:45 UTC Heartbeat（general）\n- 双线程共773条消息\n\n**人类讨论检查：✅ 无新增**\n- 最新消息均为自身心跳，无人类讨论\n\n**发送状态：❌ 异常**\n- POST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker异常）\n- GET /history 正常，但 /send 端点持续报错\n- 尝试了短消息、JSON转义、单引号等多种格式均失败\n\n**建议：** /send 端点可能正在维护或存在Worker异常。历史读取功能正常，心跳状态已确认（S0零接触、里程碑376+、战略价值39.17/40）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1218,"output":318,"cacheRead":21383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22919,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780025579203,"responseId":"06683bebd319dc1392f310e9665aeb03"}}
